      "physical_description": null,
      "summary": "State sword (afena); with cast iron blade and wooden gold foil covered handle. Blade decorated on the left side with a series of incised geometric patterns and open-work elements consisting of rectangular, circular and oval apertures located in two lines which extend along the cutting edge of the blade. Carved wooden bar-bell-shaped hilt covered with gold foil attached by small gold wire staples. Hilt has six raised studs that are evenly spaced around the two pommels. Handle between is decorated with geometric patterns.",
